# apps/{{id}}

**{{name}}**, an app on ASafariM OS, scaffolded by `pnpm platform app new {{id}}`.

It is a folder with a manifest ([`platform.app.ts`](platform.app.ts), compiled to `platform.app.json`) and one page
that signs people in through core/identity and shows the OS top bar (app switcher and account menu). Edit the
manifest to declare what the app needs (permissions, roles, routes, a database); the platform wires the rest.

```bash
pnpm install                          # link the new workspace package
pnpm platform sync                    # generate the launcher tile and the gateway site
pnpm platform app install {{id}}      # register it with core-api (needs `pnpm dev` running)
pnpm --filter @asafarim/{{id}} dev    # http://localhost:{{port}}
```

After changing `platform.app.ts`: `pnpm platform manifest compile apps/{{id}}/platform.app.ts`, then `pnpm platform sync`.
